{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Use this to answer \"does product X have/support Y\" and for the full profile of one product: every documented attribute with verification_state, confidence, observed_on and source URLs; scoped values (one edition, region or package only), withdrawn statements, register identifiers and the vendor mark. Needs the slug from search_products. Prices are at /api/v1/products/{slug}/prices. An attribute with verification_state \"unknown\" was searched and not found - say so, and never report it as the product lacking the feature.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"attributes":{"default":"all","description":"\"all\" returns every attribute including the unknown ones; \"documented\" omits the unknown ones and counts them instead. Use \"documented\" to save context when the gaps do not matter.","enum":["documented","all"],"type":"string"},"slug":{"description":"The product slug from search_products, e.g. \"apple-macbook-air\".","maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*$","type":"string"}},"required":["slug"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_product","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"attributes":{"additionalProperties":{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"confidence":{"type":["number","null"]},"label":{"type":["string","null"]},"observed_on":{"type":["string","null"]},"sources":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"retrieved_on":{"type":["string","null"]},"role":{"type":"string"},"tier":{"type":["number","null"]},"type":{"type":["string","null"]},"url":{"type":"string"}},"required":["url"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"unit":{"type":["string","null"]},"value":{},"verification_state":{"type":"string"}},"required":["verification_s